00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:41.419
our context sensitivity.

88
00:03:41.419 --> 00:03:42.259
There we go.

89
00:03:42.259 --> 00:03:45.819
We wanna transform a get actor location.

90
00:03:45.819 --> 00:03:49.870
Then we're gonna look for our get controlled

91
00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.789
and we want this get controlled pawn.

92
00:03:52.789 --> 00:03:54.069
So there we go.

93
00:03:54.069 --> 00:03:56.150
And I'm actually just gonna delete these

