131
00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.240
No, we want them to be relatively close to it.

132
00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.459
So let's go ahead and set this up now.

133
00:05:37.459 --> 00:05:39.000
And we're gonna pop over here to the editor.

