137
00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.459
So if you ever want to do a line trace ever again,

138
00:05:50.459 --> 00:05:53.100
following this will get you set up

139
00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:56.100
and a way that will be successful

140
00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.379
pretty much every single time.

141
00:05:57.379 --> 00:05:59.060
So let's grab our controlled pawn.

