157
00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:34.939
There we go.

158
00:06:34.939 --> 00:06:37.079
And we're gonna do two, one, two, three.

159
00:06:37.079 --> 00:06:39.220
So by 2000.

160
00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.100
And then what we're gonna do

161
00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.699
is we're gonna take our get actor location.

162
00:06:43.699 --> 00:06:46.519
We're going to multiply it by this offset value.

163
00:06:46.519 --> 00:06:49.899
And then we're gonna plug that in to our end right there.

